10:Teb4,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","description":"PCブラウザ・スマホアプリゲーム『刀剣乱舞-ONLINE-』を原案としたストレートプレイの舞台化作品。殺陣をふんだんに取り入れたシリアスなストーリー展開が特徴で、刀剣男士たちが歴史改変を目論む敵と戦う姿を描く。脚本・演出は末満健一が一貫して手掛けている。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/series/butai-touken-ranbu","hasPart":[{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"十周年記念特別公演 舞台『刀剣乱舞』陽伝 月と太陽と星々よ","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-yoden"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』禺伝 矛盾源氏物語～再演～","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-guden-re"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』士伝 真贋見極める眼","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-shiden-shingan"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』十口伝 あまねく刻の遥かへ","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-koden"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』心伝 つけたり奇譚の走馬灯","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-shiden"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』山姥切国広 単独行 −日本刀史−","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-tandokugyo"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』七周年感謝祭 −夢語刀宴會−","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-7th-anniversary"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』禺伝 矛盾源氏物語","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-guden"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』綺伝 いくさ世の徒花","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-kiden"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』无伝 夕紅の士 −大坂夏の陣−","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-muden"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』天伝 蒼空の兵 −大坂冬の陣−","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-tenden"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"科白劇 舞台『刀剣乱舞/灯』綺伝 いくさ世の徒花 改変 いくさ世の徒花の記憶","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-kahakugeki"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』維伝 朧の志士たち","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-iden"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』慈伝 日日の葉よ散るらむ","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-r